@startuml sl-06-1-renewal
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam roundcorner 6
skinparam conditionStyle inside

title Flow 6.1 — Storage Contract Renewal & Conflict Resolution (Activity Swimlane)

|System|
start
:Run daily renewal scan scheduler at 08:00 AM;
:Detect active contracts reaching T-20 days before expiration (BR-REN-01);
:Send renewal reminder notification & payment prompt to customer (BR-REN-02);

|Storage Customer|
:Receive renewal reminder notification;
:Access My Units portal & click "Renew Contract";
:Select renewal extension period (1 to 12 months) (BR-REN-03);

|System|
:Check if storage unit has a conflicting future reservation (BR-REN-04);

if (Unit has no future booking conflict?) then (no conflict)
  |System|
  :Calculate renewal fee based on current facility pricing;
  :Preserve original security deposit (no duplicate deposit charged) (BR-DEP-01);
  :Generate VNPay checkout URL for renewal fee;

  |Storage Customer|
  :Review renewal quotation and pay via VNPay;

  |System|
  :Verify payment transaction SUCCESS;
  :Extend RentalContract end date by selected renewal duration (BR-REN-05);
  :Create ContractRenewal record with status COMPLETED;
  :Send renewed digital lease addendum and confirmation to customer;

  |Storage Customer|
  :Receive renewal confirmation; uninterrupted unit access continues;
  stop

else (conflict - future reservation exists)
  |System|
  :Identify conflicting reservation queue;
  if (Alternative vacant unit of same unit type available for future reserver?) then (bumper reroute)
    :Reassign future reservation to alternative vacant storage unit (BR-REN-06);
    :Clear conflict on current customer unit;
    :Proceed with current customer renewal payment invoice;
    |Storage Customer|
    :Complete renewal payment via VNPay;
    |System|
    :Extend current contract end date (BR-REN-05);
    stop
  else (cannot resolve conflict)
    :Display conflict warning: Storage unit reserved by another customer;
    :Block renewal on current unit;
    |Storage Customer|
    :Receive notice to either return unit on expiration date or book a different unit;
    stop
  endif
endif
@enduml

